.TH NOSPC 1 "June 2024" "nospc 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
nospc \- detect and highlight whitespace characters other than the ASCII space and tab

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nospc
[\fI-c|--color\fR] [\fI-b|--bracket\fR] [\fI-r|--recursive\fR] [\fI--crlf\fR] \fIfilename\fR...

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B nospc
is a utility to detect and highlight whitespace characters other than the ASCII space and tab in text files. It reports carriage returns (\er) and other non-standard whitespace within each input line, while line feeds (\en) are treated as line separators. It supports highlighting using either colored text or enclosing characters in brackets.

.PP
Input files are read as UTF-8. Files that cannot be decoded as UTF-8 are reported as not valid UTF-8 text. Line feeds (\en) delimit lines and are not reported; carriage returns (\er) inside those lines are reported. With \fB--crlf\fR, a carriage return is ignored only when it appears immediately before the line feed in a CRLF ending.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-c, \--color
Enable color highlighting. If \fBtermcolor\fR is unavailable, output falls back to plain text.
.TP
.B \-b, \--bracket
Enable bracket highlighting with Unicode information.
.TP
.B \-r, \--recursive
Recursively process directories.
.TP
.B \--crlf
Ignore carriage returns only when they are part of CRLF line endings.

.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIfilename\fR
One or more input filenames. Use "-" to read from standard input.

.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Detect and highlight whitespace characters other than the ASCII space and tab in a file using colored text:
.RS
.nf
.B nospc -c file.txt
.RE
.fi
.TP
Detect and highlight whitespace characters other than the ASCII space and tab in a file using brackets:
.RS
.nf
.B nospc -b file.txt
.RE
.fi
.TP
Read from standard input and highlight using colored text:
.RS
.nf
.B cat file.txt | nospc -c -
.RE
.fi
.TP
Read from standard input and highlight using brackets:
.RS
.nf
.B cat file.txt | nospc -b -
.RE
.fi
.TP
Ignore carriage return only when it is part of a CRLF line ending:
.RS
.nf
.B nospc --crlf file.txt
.RE
.fi
